	column 'Delivery Date DC' = ```
			
			VAR _Val = VALUE( Details[Liefertermin VZ] )
			
			RETURN
			    IF( 
			        ISBLANK( _Val ) , 
			        BLANK() ,
			        DATE( VALUE( LEFT( _Val , 4 ) ), VALUE( MID( _Val , 5 , 2 ) ) , VALUE( RIGHT( _Val , 2 ) ) )
			    )
			```
